{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-markdown-remark-frontmatter-slug-js","path":"/projects/ai4pd/thrusts/imaging/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<h1>Imaging Biomarkers: DaTscan + T1 Feature Extraction</h1>\n<p><em>Part of <a href=\"/projects/ai4pd/\">AI4PD</a> · <a href=\"/projects/ai4pd/approach/#thrusts\">Approach</a></em></p>\n<p>We operate a fully automated pipeline that ingests DaT-SPECT and T1-weighted MRI, performs atlas-constrained segmentation, and produces patient-specific biomarker matrices. SegFormer, pretrained on Mindboggle-101 and fine-tuned on PPMI data, generates 108 Desikan–Killiany–Tourville region-of-interest (ROI) masks per subject. Each DaT-SPECT volume is coregistered to MNI space and summarized within every ROI using Gaussian-process moments (mean, standard deviation, skewness, and kurtosis). The resulting imaging matrix—concatenated volumetrics and DaT features—becomes a first-class citizen in downstream classification, ranking, and co-clustering agents.</p>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/afa38542692ce8e16d4098923f3eaa9e/ad997/SegmentationPreprocessing.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 66.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='Imaging feature extraction pipeline' title='' src='/static/afa38542692ce8e16d4098923f3eaa9e/5a190/SegmentationPreprocessing.png' srcset='/static/afa38542692ce8e16d4098923f3eaa9e/772e8/SegmentationPreprocessing.png 200w,\n/static/afa38542692ce8e16d4098923f3eaa9e/e17e5/SegmentationPreprocessing.png 400w,\n/static/afa38542692ce8e16d4098923f3eaa9e/5a190/SegmentationPreprocessing.png 800w,\n/static/afa38542692ce8e16d4098923f3eaa9e/ad997/SegmentationPreprocessing.png 1012w' sizes='(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/6d844c5eed9826a7af3e6196adb5a1d6/22c86/NewProcess.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 55.99999999999999%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='Analysis workflow for DaT and MRI features' title='' src='/static/6d844c5eed9826a7af3e6196adb5a1d6/5a190/NewProcess.png' srcset='/static/6d844c5eed9826a7af3e6196adb5a1d6/772e8/NewProcess.png 200w,\n/static/6d844c5eed9826a7af3e6196adb5a1d6/e17e5/NewProcess.png 400w,\n/static/6d844c5eed9826a7af3e6196adb5a1d6/5a190/NewProcess.png 800w,\n/static/6d844c5eed9826a7af3e6196adb5a1d6/22c86/NewProcess.png 1143w' sizes='(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h2>Results That Matter</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Imaging alone provides fair discrimination of CSFSAA status, achieving an AUC of 0.70 ± 0.08, with larger cuneus volume and smaller pars opercularis and putamen volumes distinguishing CSFSAA-negative patients.</li>\n<li>Non-imaging anchors such as UPSIT (0.76 ± 0.08) and di-22:6-BMP (0.86 ± 0.08) are strong single-modality predictors; fusing imaging with clinical and biological features yields an AUC of 0.93 ± 0.04.</li>\n<li>Co-clustering with imaging features reveals two SAA-low subgroups (0% and 4% CSFSAA-positive; <em>p</em> &#x3C; 10⁻³ and <em>p</em> &#x3C; 10⁻⁴) and one SAA-high subgroup (73.8%; <em>p</em> &#x3C; 10⁻³).</li>\n<li>Salient imaging drivers concentrate in cuneus volume, paracentral DaT-SPECT skewness, and pallidal DaT-SPECT skewness.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; '>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/77796c13c493449de01e91640c36c6a7/471ef/CoclusterImages.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 71.50000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='Representative subgroup-specific imaging markers' title='' src='/static/77796c13c493449de01e91640c36c6a7/5a190/CoclusterImages.png' srcset='/static/77796c13c493449de01e91640c36c6a7/772e8/CoclusterImages.png 200w,\n/static/77796c13c493449de01e91640c36c6a7/e17e5/CoclusterImages.png 400w,\n/static/77796c13c493449de01e91640c36c6a7/5a190/CoclusterImages.png 800w,\n/static/77796c13c493449de01e91640c36c6a7/471ef/CoclusterImages.png 1185w' sizes='(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h2>Why It Matters</h2>\n<p>This thrust makes DaT-SPECT interpretable at scale by replacing manual ROI definition with reproducible, patient-specific segmentation. It shortens processing from hours to minutes, keeps DaT features paired with structural anatomy, and feeds our multimodal co-clustering and policy agents with harmonized inputs. Full cohort details, preprocessing, and analytics are documented in Dominick &#x26; Bajaj (2025).</p>","excerpt":"Imaging Biomarkers: DaTscan + T1 Feature Extraction Part of AI4PD · Approach We operate a fully automated pipeline that ingests DaT-SPECT and T1-weighted MRI…","frontmatter":{"title":"AI4PD Thrust 1: Imaging Biomarkers","slug":"/projects/ai4pd/thrusts/imaging"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"f2fb9ffc-4e56-5c62-850b-1593bba75b9f","frontmatter__slug":"/projects/ai4pd/thrusts/imaging","__params":{"frontmatter__slug":"projects"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1828031679","3764592887"],"slicesMap":{}}